flowchart LR
    U[User] --> UI[BreakoutGate Web UI]
    UI --> API[Server API]
    API --> IMG[Image Validation]
    IMG --> YC1[YouCam Skin Analysis Adapter]
    YC1 --> SS[Normalized SkinState]
    UI --> UC[User Constraints]
    UI --> PE[Candidate Products]
    PE --> EV[Evidence + Provenance Layer]
    SS --> DE[Deterministic Decision Engine]
    UC --> DE
    EV --> DE
    DE --> DR[Decision Receipt]
    DE --> VTOG{Eligible + Previewable?}
    VTOG -->|Yes| YC2[YouCam Makeup VTO Adapter]
    YC2 --> ART[VTO Artifact]
    ART --> DR
    DR --> UI
    VTOG -->|No| UI
